abstract: >-
  Toolbox for computing spectral colour-quality metrics (Ra, Rf, MCPI, CDM,
  MCPIr, CDMr, excitation purity, CIELAB hue angle, and related indices)
  from SPD data.
keywords:
  - lighting quality
  - colour rendering
  - SPD
  - CIE
  - GB/Z
